{{!-- Mentions received via webmention.io, rendered by assets/js/webmentions.js.

    The endpoint <link rel="webmention"> lives in default.hbs <head>, where
    senders can discover it - it was here in the body before, pointing at
    Bridgy's *publish* endpoint, which receives nothing.

    No <script> tag here: webmentions.js is bundled into main.min.js by the
    assets/js/*.js glob in gulpfile.js. It was also loaded twice more (a
    hardcoded /assets/js/ path here and an {{asset}} tag in site-scripts), so
    three WebmentionHandlers each fetched and each overwrote this container.

    Styles are in assets/css/screen.css. --}}
<div id="webmentions">
    <small class="global-subtitle-title">
        <a href="https://janmonschke.com/adding-webmentions-to-your-static-blog/" target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">mentions</a>
    </small>
</div>
